{"body": "This fixes an issue reported to the dev list by Sudsport.\nThe problem is that expression operations were not using the latest version of the schema in some places, where the schema is taken from a partition spec. When the schema is updated, partition specs need to be rebuilt with the new schema so that expression binding always uses the current schema.", "date": "2019-02-20T21:43:47Z", "hash": "sha256:1d455aa6b75ed8b36342", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#108", "meta": {"additions": 176, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-04-04T16:25:25Z", "comments": 3, "deletions": 33, "draft": false, "files": ["core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/BaseSnapshot.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/BaseTableScan.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ManifestGroup.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ManifestReader.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/MergingSnapshotUpdate.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/RemoveSnapshots.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/SnapshotUpdate.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/TableMetadata.java", "core/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/TestScansAndSchemaEvolution.java"], "merged_at": "2019-04-04T16:25:25Z", "merged_by": "rdblue", "n_files": 9, "number": 108, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2019-02-27T15:42:02Z", "by": "fbocse", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-02-27T17:23:30Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-02-28T23:32:57Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "APPROVED"}, {"at": "2019-03-01T15:51:24Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-03-24T22:39:57Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-03-25T18:41:52Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-04-03T23:54:02Z", "by": "jzhuge", "state": "APPROVED"}, {"at": "2019-04-04T02:08:05Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "APPROVED"}], "state": "merged", "thumbs_up": 2, "updated_at": "2019-04-04T16:25:43Z"}, "people": ["rdblue"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "Use the